cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use useful-views in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "useful-views: documented derived tables for research data projects"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that gives a research data project a fixed structure, in
  which every derived table (a "useful view") records the recipe, inputs and
  steps that made it, in a standard Data Package.
authors:
  - family-names: Horine
    given-names: James
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jameshorine/useful-views"
url: "https://jameshorine.github.io/useful-views/"
keywords:
  - research data
  - reproducibility
  - data provenance
  - data package
  - python
